flowchart TD
    start["Start here: immutable root and pool layout"]:::start
    bootstrap["Caller bootstrap and owner creation"]
    history["Owner history: clean operation events"]
    tail["Owner tail: stop, failure and collection"]
    resolve{"Actual holders resolved<br/>and original lock acquired?"}
    burn["Burn both owner ranges<br/>including empty slots"]
    successor["One caller-owned collection successor"]
    final["Caller final lane<br/>No successor after caller loss"]
    unknown["Unavailable tail<br/>No replacement writer"]
    rule["Every lane: odd slots are fences; even slots are other events<br/>Choose once, burn skipped slots, retain every prefix"]
    start -->|1. Preassign all slots and attachments| bootstrap
    bootstrap -->|2. Exclusive writer transfer| history
    history -->|3. First failure or stop closes history| tail
    tail -->|4a. Handoff and established original-lock transfer| final
    history -.->|Owner loss| resolve
    tail -.->|Owner loss| resolve
    resolve -->|No| unknown
    resolve -->|Yes, layout and frontier valid| burn
    burn -->|4b. Recovery and collection-only opening| successor
    successor -->|5. Only proven unattempted collection items| final
    successor -.->|Caller loss| unknown
    start -.-> rule
    classDef start fill:#17324d,color:#fff,font-weight:bold,stroke:#17324d
